  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**例题.** 在杠杆的短臂上挂一个质量为100千克的重物.",
        "为提升此重物而在长臂上施加一个250牛顿的力. 若重物被",
        "提升的高度为$h_1=0.08$米，而动力的作用点下降的高度为",
        "$h_2=0.4$米，试求此杠杆的机械效率."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解：**重物的重量$P=gm$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$P=9.8$牛顿/千克$\\times100$千克$\\approx1000$牛顿. 有用功$A_{\\text{有用}}↵=Ph_1$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A_{\\text{有用}}=1000$牛顿$\\times0.08$米$=80$焦耳."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "总功$A=Fh_2$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A=250$牛顿$\\times0.4$米$=100$焦耳."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "机械效率$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}\\times100\\%$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**$K=\\frac{80\\text{焦耳}}{100\\text{焦耳}}\\times100\\%=80\\%$.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
